# Netlify SPA fallback — required by SEO-01.
#
# Routing now uses real paths (/product/sphatik-shivling) instead of fragments,
# because a search engine treats a #fragment as a position within one document
# rather than a separate URL — which meant the entire catalog was a single
# indexable page.
#
# Real paths only work if the host serves index.html for a path that has no file
# behind it. Without this rule, /product/sphatik-shivling is a hard 404 for
# anyone arriving from a search result, a shared link, or a page refresh.
#
# The 200 (not 301/302) is the important part: it rewrites internally and keeps
# the requested URL in the address bar, so the app can read location.pathname
# and render the right view.

# Real files win first — these two are served as themselves, not rewritten.
/robots.txt   /robots.txt   200
/sitemap.xml  /sitemap.xml  200

# The admin console is a separate document and must not be swallowed by the
# storefront's catch-all below.
/admin        /admin.html   200
/admin/*      /admin.html   200

# Everything else renders the storefront.
/*            /index.html   200
